# Synced license-plate assets (~56 MB total); stored as normal blobs so CI/HF deploy
# clones don't require GitHub LFS (HF deploy strips binaries from the Space push anyway).
# Last so it wins: in .gitattributes the later matching line overrides the earlier one, and the *.png / *.jpg
# LFS lines above would otherwise reclaim these files and show them as modified in every checkout.
web_app/public/wikicommons/** -filter -diff -merge
